<!-- My Launch Study (running artifact) for Ambitious Science Teaching, Unit 1:
     Investigating Matter. Mirrors the sections of wp_print, one Collapsible each.
     Every section is always here, with a dash where nothing has been written yet:
     the tab is opened early to see what goes where, and a page that grows section
     by section reads as broken. Exporting is wp_print's job, not this tab's. -->
